(ag) Liens securing any Indebtedness permitted under Section 7.03(b)(y), (e), (g) or (h)(ii) that are secured by Liens on the same assets as the Liens securing the Indebtedness being modified, refinanced, refunded, renewed, replaced or extended by such Indebtedness, plus improvements, accessions, dividends, distributions, proceeds or products thereof and after-acquired property;
