(ak) Liens on cash and Cash Equivalents intended to be used in connection with a defeasance, satisfaction and discharge, redemption or repurchase of Indebtedness; provided that such defeasance, satisfaction and discharge, redemption or repurchase is permitted under Section 7.10.
